  "title": "Slow Cooker Mediterranean Stew",
  "description": "Butternut (or acorn) squash, eggplant, zucchini, okra and carrots are the heart of this crockpot vegetable stew, slow cooked with tomato sauce, vegetable broth and raisins. Excellent served over rice or couscous.",
